"P1277944063" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>Your next task will be to dive head first into one of the most dangerous places on this rock: a Snake hole.</a> Come out alive, and I'll know you're worth watching. But be warned: not everyone seeking a great destiny survives, {VillainName}. Some find themselves crushed to fine powder by the weight of their own mediocrity."
