// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1875714153" "Are you aware of the lowly creatures known as the Infected? They've been subsisting off the water from the cesspool trenches, and it's made them a bit of a problem. Many of them have gained enormous strength; in addition, they seem to have lost all sense and reason. There are a number of them massing in a warehouse nearby. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Someone has to eliminate them, and I want that someone to be you.</a> It'll give me an idea of whether you are worthy of further tests."
// AcceptString :
"P1756270203" "Eliminate the Infected"
// SendOffString :
"P2378615543" "These creatures have proved themselves unfit for Arachnos' great future, and as a result they must be culled. Don't let this happen to you, {VillainName}. Remember, I am always watching you."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P746573323" "You have a job to do, {VillainName}. Prove your value to me."

